Nymi Bluetooth Endpoint Daemon is part of Nymi's Connected Worker Platform (CWP)

The Nymi Bluetooth Endpoint Daemon (nbed) is part of Nymi's Connected Worker Platform (CWP) or Nymi endpoint software.

Its job is to act as a local Bluetooth service that communicates with Nymi Bands and the rest of the Nymi authentication stack. 

At a high level, it:

- Manages the local Bluetooth Adapter
- Communicates with the Nymi Agent / Runtime
- Discovers and tracks Nymi Bands
- Supports authentication and workstation unlock workflows
- Monitors service health
